"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/547670/extras/3f5ae95d9a475a9564d2924f36a7e2b7.webp?t=1712084829\" /></div><br>Enjoy Musical Range with your own music. Expand your private music library with new songs and have fun.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/547670/extras/41a95509d0e41e941cc4202a7080381c.poster.avif?t=1712084829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/547670/extras/41a95509d0e41e941cc4202a7080381c.webm?t=1712084829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/547670/extras/41a95509d0e41e941cc4202a7080381c.mp4?t=1712084829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Are you ready to ROCK the world with Musical Range? Grab your headset, feel the music and become a ROCKSTAR!",
